{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B544303", "geste": "G13", "modalite": "présent", "appui": "we train on the emitted tokens from the HMM, and not the hidden states or the beliefs themselves […] This is important because the theory we develop is quite general to the normal setting of transformer pretraining", "doute": false}
{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B544303", "geste": "G14", "modalite": "moins-de-trois", "appui": "", "doute": true}
