{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B544303", "geste": "G17", "modalite": "dispersées", "appui": "though not perfectly; we do have a few leads for these deviations […] Our experiments, though in a toy setting", "doute": false}
{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B544303", "geste": "G18", "modalite": "absentes", "appui": "", "doute": false}
{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B544303", "geste": "G19", "modalite": "posée-sans-contrôle", "appui": "power-law scaling of in-context loss can also arise from a single ergodic component with context-free or more sophisticated grammatical structure", "doute": true}
{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B544303", "geste": "G20", "modalite": "suite-des-auteurs-seule", "appui": "In the future we plan to make more thorough explainers for some of these projects", "doute": false}
