{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B685128", "geste": "G01", "modalite": "affirmation-atténuée", "appui": "Astra appears to perform belief-propagation-like inference without CoT", "doute": false}
{"codeur": "C1", "billet": "B685128", "geste": "G02", "modalite": "premier-paragraphe", "appui": "Together, these results suggest that Astra performs some kind of iterative, belief-propagation-like probabilistic inference internally.", "doute": false}
